@startuml sequence-share-link
!theme blueprint
title Sequence Діаграма - Створення та Доступ до Share Link

actor User as "Користувач"
participant Frontend as "React Frontend"
participant Backend as "Spring Boot\nBackend"
participant ShareLinkService as "ShareLinkService"
participant AuthKeyService as "AuthKeyService"
participant Database as "PostgreSQL"
participant Redis as "Redis Cache"

== Створення Share Link ==

User -> Frontend: Обрати ключ для sharing
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: Розшифрувати ключ\n(Zero-Knowledge)
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/share-links\n{keyId, encryptedValue, expiresAt}
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: Перевірити JWT токен\n(Security Filter)

Backend -> ShareLinkService: createShareLink(request)
activate ShareLinkService

ShareLinkService -> AuthKeyService: getAuthKeyById(keyId)
activate AuthKeyService
AuthKeyService -> Database: SELECT * FROM auth_keys\nWHERE id = ?
Database --> AuthKeyService: AuthKey entity
deactivate AuthKeyService

ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Перевірити права\nвласності ключа

ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Згенерувати\nунікальний token\n(UUID)

ShareLinkService -> Database: INSERT INTO share_links\n(token, auth_key_id,\nencrypted_value,\nexpires_at, max_access_count)
Database --> ShareLinkService: ShareLink entity

ShareLinkService -> Redis: SETEX share_link:{token}\n{shareLink} EX {TTL}
Redis --> ShareLinkService: OK

ShareLinkService --> Backend: ShareLinkResponse
deactivate ShareLinkService

Backend --> Frontend: 201 Created\n{token, shareUrl, expiresAt}
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: Показати modal\nз share URL
Frontend --> User: Share URL скопійовано
deactivate Frontend

== Доступ до Share Link ==

actor Recipient as "Отримувач"
participant RecipientBrowser as "Browser\n(Recipient)"

Recipient -> RecipientBrowser: Відкрити share URL\n(https://.../share/{token})
activate RecipientBrowser

RecipientBrowser -> Backend: GET /api/share-links/{token}
activate Backend

Backend -> ShareLinkService: getShareLinkByToken(token)
activate ShareLinkService

ShareLinkService -> Redis: GET share_link:{token}
activate Redis
Redis --> ShareLinkService: ShareLink data (якщо є в кеші)
deactivate Redis

alt Знайдено в Redis Cache
    ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Перевірити expiration\nта access count
else Не знайдено в Cache
    ShareLinkService -> Database: SELECT * FROM share_links\nWHERE token = ?\nAND is_active = true
    Database --> ShareLinkService: ShareLink entity

    ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Перевірити expiration\nта access count

    ShareLinkService -> Redis: SETEX share_link:{token}\n{shareLink} EX {TTL}
    Redis --> ShareLinkService: OK
end

alt Посилання валідне
    ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Інкрементувати\naccess count

    ShareLinkService -> Database: UPDATE share_links\nSET access_count = access_count + 1\nWHERE id = ?
    Database --> ShareLinkService: Updated

    alt Досягнуто max_access_count
        ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Деактивувати link
        ShareLinkService -> Database: UPDATE share_links\nSET is_active = false\nWHERE id = ?
        Database --> ShareLinkService: Updated

        ShareLinkService -> Redis: DEL share_link:{token}
        Redis --> ShareLinkService: OK
    end

    ShareLinkService -> AuthKeyService: getAuthKeyById(keyId)
    activate AuthKeyService
    AuthKeyService -> Database: SELECT * FROM auth_keys\nWHERE id = ?
    Database --> AuthKeyService: AuthKey metadata
    deactivate AuthKeyService

    ShareLinkService --> Backend: ShareLinkViewResponse\n{keyName, encryptedValue,\nexpiresAt, accessCount}

    Backend --> RecipientBrowser: 200 OK\n{shareLinkData}

    RecipientBrowser -> RecipientBrowser: Показати ключ\n(read-only)
    RecipientBrowser --> Recipient: Відобразити зашифрований ключ

else Посилання невалідне (expired або max access)
    ShareLinkService --> Backend: throw ShareLinkExpiredException\nабо ShareLinkNotFoundException

    Backend --> RecipientBrowser: 404 Not Found\nабо 410 Gone

    RecipientBrowser --> Recipient: "Посилання прострочене\nабо недійсне"
end

deactivate ShareLinkService
deactivate Backend
deactivate RecipientBrowser

== Видалення Share Link ==

User -> Frontend: Видалити share link
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: DELETE /api/share-links/{id}
activate Backend

Backend -> ShareLinkService: deleteShareLink(id, userId)
activate ShareLinkService

ShareLinkService -> Database: SELECT * FROM share_links\nWHERE id = ? AND user_id = ?
Database --> ShareLinkService: ShareLink entity

ShareLinkService -> ShareLinkService: Перевірити права\nвласності

ShareLinkService -> Database: UPDATE share_links\nSET is_active = false,\ndeleted_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = ?
Database --> ShareLinkService: Updated

ShareLinkService -> Redis: DEL share_link:{token}
Redis --> ShareLinkService: OK

ShareLinkService --> Backend: Success
deactivate ShareLinkService

Backend --> Frontend: 204 No Content
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Frontend: Оновити список\nshare links
Frontend --> User: Link видалено
deactivate Frontend

note over User, Redis
  **Особливості Zero-Knowledge:**
  - Frontend розшифровує ключ перед відправкою
  - Backend зберігає зашифроване значення
  - Отримувач бачить зашифроване значення
  - Можливість розшифрування тільки з master password
end note

@enduml
